le=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 02-26-2023, 10:02 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-26T13:38:23-08:00","id":1503963,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KaiserAfini</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1501180-in-the-hallowed-light-mtaw2e-ooc?p=1503943#post1503943\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Since activating any type of Active Mage Sight will trigger the Peripheral Sight of everyone else, I haven't had Qaf activate Time sight because I am not sure if it would be considered bad manners by this Consilia's hospitality rules. What are the general ones we would have been taught ?</div> </div> </div> </div>The Consilium's hospitality rules basically boil down to -<br /> <br /> 1. Don't take Mana from a Hallow unless you're sure it isn't claimed. Little Atlantis is chock full of them, and most claimed Hallows are fairly clearly marked<br /> <br /> 2. Let other people know if you're casting a spell or activating something that will ping Mage Sight, to avoid unfortunate accidents<br /> <br /> 3. Changelings/Werewolves and their brands of Magic should be declared at the door. Likewise, any Invisible Entities need to be announced upon arrival<br /> <br /> 4. Guests can request up to a dram (one point) of Mana per person<br /> <br /> 5. Santiago and Cloudchaser specifically ban Prime Unveiling/Knowing on their premises, but most households have similar impositions against the study of their defenses. This should be declared by the host at the door<br /> <br /> 6. A request for sanctuary must be honored for at least 24 hours, unless irrefutable proof of Left-Handed activty (including Rapture and being a practicing Seer) is presented.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-26T13:40:40-08:00","id":1503964,"title":"","content":"/sigh. Flagged for spam. Part relevant to you - warn people if you're about to ping PMS, no studying the host's defenses without permission.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-27T16:01:21-08:00","id":1504003,"title":"","content":"Cloudchaser will present a few options for Hallows - some of which will also have dots of Sanctum and/or Safe Place. These are &quot;free&quot; dots, subject to my whims as an ST, unless/until you invest XP in them. Don't feel pressured to - I'll only affect them if it's necessary to advance the story.<br /> <br /> Most of the Hallows will have downsides - someone has superceeding rights to access the area but will not take mana, Avernian Gates and Hedgeways, very public locations, etc.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-27T17:05:56-08:00","id":1504007,"title":"","content":"That sounds pretty cool, looking forward to it.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Hey, did you feel a chill ? WERE THOSE SCREAMS !? (Message Numen). Get down, the silverwear is flying everywhere&quot; (Telekinesis Numen). The ghost is just as terrified as he is baffled.<br /> <br /> The Reaper stops for a sec &quot;Its no use, neither of them can see us, and we will be long gone before they can get someone who can&quot; He presents his mask in front of a lighted train tunnel, only they see the shadows stretch out to consume the lights, an eerie red glow emerges from the other side. The coppery smell of a bloody mist fills the ghost's senses as he is being dragged by his captor. As they cross into the light, the glow ceases and the tunnel is pitch black once more. The lights flicker back on, illuminating it once more, no traces remain of what transpired in the part of the station, hidden in the shadow of death.</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-27T17:46:28-08:00","id":1504008,"title":"","content":"Seconded, this is cool. I'm definitely interested in those downsides. They sound fun.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-27T20:22:27-08:00","id":1504016,"title":"","content":"Prospect Yard: Hallow 3, Safe Place 1<br /> <br /> Njord's Draught: Hallow 2 (Technically 4, but you only get half the Tass), Safe Place 2<br /> <br /> Stone Oak: Hallow 4, Safe Place 4, Sanctum 2. Requires social skill checks for ownership.<br /> <br /> Hyleen Cottage: Hallow 1, Safe Place 1 Sanctum 3<br /> <br /> Tesslin's Hollow: Hallow 5","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-27T21:24:41-08:00","id":1504017,"title":"","content":"First of all, these are great.<br /> <br /> So, if I may summarize the story hook portions of the locations are, as I understand:<br /> <br /> Prospect Yard: ghosts. And creepy stuff. And moderate sleeper stuff. Might have Free Council stuff going on, might not.<br /> <br /> Njord's Draught: Changeling, and high sleeper stuff. Probably high Mage stuff too, given the Marshals, and what they do.<br /> <br /> Stone Oak: Werewolves and Shadow shenanigans.<br /> <br /> Hyleen Cottage: low obvious plot hooks, but isolated.<br /> <br /> Tesslin\u2019s Hollow: Cultists? Fish people? Mad kelp sprites? Who knows?<br /> <br /> So my thoughts:<br /> Elpis is unfortunately probably going to veto Stone Oak since it\u2019s on a loci. They are creeped out by the idea of spirits, and dealing with werewolves isn\u2019t something they want to do on a regular basis. I like the visual though, and the merits are nice.<br /> Prospect Yard is not bad for Elpis, they like singing, and don\u2019t find the dead to be scary, mostly just sad. Not exactly sure what the safe place 1 represents? Need to look up how Prime interacts with seeing Ephemeral Entities.<br /> Njord\u2019s Draught is interesting, I do like Changeling, and Elpis has Mind. Lots of people to deal with though.<br /> Hyleen Cottage: Elpis\u2019 favored option. They like anywhere where they don\u2019t have to deal with too many people, and will probably think of the fixer upper part as a good chance to get to know Qaf. One benefit is that if we want to improve the merits, it doesn\u2019t have as much narrative problems as other options. Down side is less opportunities for story stuff from our home.<br /> Tesslin\u2019s Hollow is interesting, but I think impractical. Might be good for a remote gathering spell, but that takes up spell control.<br /> \u200b<br /> I think Prospect Yard, Njord\u2019s Draught, and Hyleen Cottage are all good. Thoughts?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":26736,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","user":"TempleBuilder","date":". 02-28-2023, 12:57 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-27T21:51:53-08:00","id":1504020,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TempleBuilder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1501180-in-the-hallowed-light-mtaw2e-ooc?p=1504017#post1504017\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">First of all, these are great.</div> </div> </div> </div>Glad you like 'em!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TempleBuilder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1501180-in-the-hallowed-light-mtaw2e-ooc?p=1504017#post1504017\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not exactly sure what the safe place 1 represents?</div> </div> </div> </div> A chest-high wall around the area, a grounds keeper, a trio of bound Ghosts, and a grounds keeper's office done up to look like a mausoleum. The office actually stands over the mouth of a small catacomb, although that is very rarely used.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-28T04:19:25-08:00","id":1504034,"title":"","content":"All sound really interesting, and I agree with TempleBuilder's analysis. From Qaf's point of view:<br /> <br /> Prospect Yard: We can't defend from what we can't perceive. A graveyard means an Avernian Gate, which is a backdoor waiting to be exploited.<br /> <br /> Njord's Draught: Promising. He has no problem with Changelings, so long as he is very precise with his wording. Well defended, nice amount of tass, a solid choice. Main drawback is possibly being caught in the crossfire of the Hedgemarshals.<br /> <br /> Stone Oak: Hard veto. The werewolves will not be very receptive of people placed there by the ones contending with them about the weather. Plus if diplomacy sours, which the military grade defenses suggest is likely, dealing with a storm of fangs and claws is far beyond our weight class. Lastly, neither of us can perceive spirits, meaning we once more have a backdoor, but with even more dangerous neighbors.<br /> <br /> Hyleen Cottage: Promising. It has baseline defenses and while the Hallow is the weakest of them, having a well designed Sanctum means we can throw many more defenses in an emergency. One question though, what is empowering this location ? Any gates to the Realms Invisible ? Stories from the previous owners ? Folk tales ? Seasonal events ?<br /> <br /> Tesslin's Hollow: Could we get more info please ?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 02-28-2023, 09:10 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-28T04:26:25-08:00","id":1504035,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KaiserAfini</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1501180-in-the-hallowed-light-mtaw2e-ooc?p=1504034#post1504034\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hyleen Cottage: Promising. It has baseline defenses and while the Hallow is the weakest of them, having a well designed Sanctum means we can throw many more defenses in an emergency. One question though, what is empowering this location ? Any gates to the Realms Invisible ? Stories from the previous owners ? Folk tales ? Seasonal events ?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'll note that it has such a high Sanctum rating due to having been abandoned for so long. The basement and attic haven't had souled entities in them for an appreciable amout of time for quite a while, so they have very little ambient resonance beyond whatever is seeping out from the Hallow.<br /> <br /> Are those IC or OOC questions?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KaiserAfini</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1501180-in-the-hallowed-light-mtaw2e-ooc?p=1504034#post1504034\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Tesslin's Hollow: Could we get more info please ?</div> </div> </div> </div>Sure, what would you like to know?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":27258,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","user":"Cauthon","date":". 02-28-2023, 07:35 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-28T22:48:29-08:00","id":1504107,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27258_4.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27258\" data-vbnamecard=\"27258\">Cauthon</a> It really likes to eat your posts, doesn\u2019t it?<br /> <br /> I\u2019m afraid I\u2019m a bit tired, but I\u2019ll have something for y\u2019all tomorrow. I plan on mostly agreeing with Qaf, and asking if we should go check out the bar and the cottage.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":26736,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","user":"TempleBuilder","date":". 03-01-2023, 01:51 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[