e Opacity of 1, bares it for both of you! Gain a Beat each [Insert catchy level up tune here because I'm too scared to add links]<br /> <br /> Surface/Deep Information<ul><li>A Life spell of the Knowing Practice.</li> <li>It seems to be a simple tripwire - passing through its boundary will alert whomever holds the spell</li> <li>The Nimbus attached to it is an impression of a tempestuous storm in spring, pounding rains that feed greedy soil cut through by shattering flashes of lightning. It has undercurrents of wandering dark forest paths in the midst of such a downpour</li> <li>Spell Factors are primarily sunk into Duration and Scale, covering the area protected by the Incognito Presence spell. It has been active for almost a month, and is set to run out in a few days. It has not been Relinquished, however.</li> </ul>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-12T17:01:05-07:00","id":1505210,"title":"","content":"Quick clarification, normal Beat or Arcane Beat ?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-for