s recognize any particulars of the symbols? Outside of general astrological stuff?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":26736,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","user":"TempleBuilder","date":". 03-19-2023, 03:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-19T13:06:18-07:00","id":1505801,"title":"","content":"By itself, Prime doesn't seem to have any translation abilities, the closest thing is the domain of revelation. Mind only has <i>Universal Language</i> as a Weaving, even though it does have language in its purview. So I theorize two approaches that may be viable for Elpis, either a Knowing of Mind would let them know what is written or a Knowing of Mind and Prime could be used to reveal the meaning of the words. I think the latter is preferable, since it would probably be able to reveal cyphers, or at least Clash against magical ones.<br /> <br /> Maybe its a Mysterium cypher, or a Skywatch one, in which case, does Qaf recognize it either ? Checking first might be more helpful for Elpis, since Mind is not Ruling, each non-Praxis or non-rote cast is exacting a mana toll.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-19T13:41:12-07:00","id":1505805,"title":"","content":"Neither of you particularly recognize the symbols, and even the &quot;astrological&quot; markings don't readily seem to line up with anything you're familiar with.<br /> <br /> Let's say a cryptology roll takes half an hour, unassisted. Spells or code breaking paraphernalia will definitely cut it down. If I remember right, <u>Universal Language</u> <i>would</i> be able to make a literal translation of anything that has been used as a language, but it doesn't provide context. So it would tell you word for word what it says, but if it's a nested code that won't tell you much.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-19T14:22:51-07:00","id":1505819,"title":"","content":"Let\u2019s say a hypothetical decryption with a spell is possible and practical. What\u2019s a good time limit on when to leave it so we can attended to other matters? Like an hour?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-19T14:33:17-07:00","id":1505823,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cauthon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1501180-in-the-hallowed-light-mtaw2e-ooc?p=1505805#post1505805\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Neither of you particularly recognize the symbols, and even the &quot;astrological&quot; markings don't readily seem to line up with anything you're familiar with.<br /> <br /> Let's say a cryptology roll takes half an hour, unassisted. Spells or code breaking paraphernalia will definitely cut it down. If I remember right, <u>Universal Language</u> <i>would</i> be able to make a literal translation of anything that has been used as a language, but it doesn't provide context. So it would tell you word for word what it says, but if it's a nested code that won't tell you much.</div> </div> </div> </div>Still tells us something at least. <br /> <br /> I guess it\u2019s a bit it\u2019s weird to me. As I understand, Prime\u2019s bailiwick is meaning and symbols\u2026which is what language is comprised of. But Mind apparently covers language. Maybe it\u2019s similar to Life and Matter being different, though Life is made of Matter.\u200b<br /> <br /> Anyways, if Elpis does cast a translation spell, how would that manifest? Would that be a flat reduction of time per roll, or would it depend on potency?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-19T14:53:18-07:00","id":1505826,"title":"","content":"I take it as Prime is more... fundamental symbols? Like how fire is perceived as dangerous by all species, but the symbol for radioactive material only has meaning to modern humans<br /> <br /> Well, since Elpis can't cast UL yet, let's say a theoretical Mind/Prime spell that assists in parsing patters and meaning from text. Say, whose each dot of Potency reducing the time between rolls by half. So Potency 1 reduces the roll interval to 15 minutes, Potency 2 to 7 minutes, etc. One scene would be a good Duration in that case, on one day with unsafe Relinquishment","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","