s=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-29T20:35:45-07:00","id":1506922,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KaiserAfini</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1501180-in-the-hallowed-light-mtaw2e-ooc?p=1506920#post1506920\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wouldn't a dramatic failure require a 1 on a chance dice? Maybe you were thinking of a nat 1 from D&amp;D ? In this case, it simply doesn't count as a success.<br /> <br /> Did you perhaps mean you were turning it into a dramatic failure for a Beat ?</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200b<br /> Oh, I thought it was any roll that failed with at least half the dice as a 1?<br /> <br /> As for the second bit, no, I don't want to botch our beginning social stuff.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":26736,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","user":"TempleBuilder","date":". 03-29-2023, 11:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-29T20:40:33-07:00","id":1506923,"title":"","content":"Looks like I'm wrong. Yay!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-29T20:53:43-07:00","id":1506925,"title":"","content":"ok, just for reference, one side of Elpis's mind is Elevator music, and the other is internally screaming emotionally-wise. I...don't know what that mix looks like, but I guess they really fail to hide it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-30T05:09:35-07:00","id":1506940,"title":"","content":"Interesting, so Elpis is surprisingly more ok with the Mind magic angle than Qaf expected. In hindsight, I think Qaf might unknowingly have given a reason to elevator Elpis on why using <i>Postcognition</i> on this meeting might not be a good idea. But since they have a direct feed, it shouldn't be an issue.<br /> <br /> I wanted to confirm something before Qaf suggests it. When robbers are breaking into a place, lights can be used as an intimidation factor. I don't mean flood lights either, if they are placed in certain areas outside, they register in the robber's mind as crossing a threshold, as going one level deeper and then they start thinking about their escape strategy. Some even lose nerve and abort, so Elpis could make a Compelling to turn nervous feelings into Frightened to repel them. Qaf has the context from his contacts to suggest that, but I wanted to confirm if physically that would make sense for the Draught.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-30T07:27:51-07:00","id":1506949,"title":"","content":"So, originally Elpis was going to realize the problem after Qaf walked off. I realized I might have given the expectation that I would post next, and figured the difference was slight enough that I should go ahead and do so. As I see it, they have 3 things to freak out about currently. One, they are spying on an official meeting where people probably don\u2019t want them to overhear, and that bothers them on a certain level. It\u2019s not enough to not actually do it, but enough to feel terrible even though they feel like they are doing the right thing. Secondly, Qaf has been nice guy so far, but they don\u2019t know what he would do if he figures out there is a spell, and who cast it. Thirdly, their long term plan doesn\u2019t work, as Qaf just pointed out. Give the a few more minutes, and they\u2019ll realize that, and hopefully finally that Qaf wanted them to cast the spells.<br /> <br /> As for the Mind magic, well that comes from a Mastigos teacher. They know that Mind Magic allows for a skilled and well-intentioned person to give balm to the aches and pains of people\u2019s hearts. They can heal trauma, deescalate situations, and generally make the world a better place. Many of those same spells can also be used to cause trauma, to rip open and eat people\u2019s hearts, leaving them as little more than hollow shells for one\u2019s own benefit. It\u2019s all in how you use it. A knife can be used to make food for oneself and others, or to kill people. Hopefully not as the same action. Anyways, they generally believe in the good of people. People should want to avoid hurting others, and to help soothe the pain of the Fallen World. Which is why that trauma-based spell hurt them so much, because they know someone had a screaming chunk of themselves ripped out to power it. They might never heal from it, and have a gaping wound in their heart forever. All because the Mages had wanted a spell to be released without a cost to themselves. And the Mages that made it were still had the grace of Sophia, whereas the mentor whom they *know* wouldn\u2019t do something like that to others had lost hers. (Maybe the Mages did it to themselves, who knows, but that\u2019s not particularly likely.)<br /> <br /> That\u2019s a great plan, and a perfectly ethical use of Mind from Elpis\u2019s point of view. We should definitely ask about its viability. Do you mind if Elpis brings it up? Or should Qaf bring it up after he gets back?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":26736,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","user":"TempleBuilder","date":". 03-30-2023, 12:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-30T09:13:07-07:00","id":1506954,"title":"","content":"Elpis will need to bring it up, Qaf figured the idea might put pressure on a recent wound, so he deliberately steered the conversation (and his summary) away from it. Plus, after seeing the initial exchange, there is probably a lot on Elpis' mind, especially if they are keeping track of what is going on upstairs. If Cauthon says the security idea makes sense, he will probably bring it up after returning from the bathroom. Right now his mind is very focused on preparing so that more people survive if the situation escalates, so he cannot go on another tangent. Its why he made the quick comment on <i>Veil of Moments</i>, so both Gil might want to ask Elpis more questions and they have more context on what might make for an interesting pitch. In this case, something that both helps their business and gives them an additional safety net.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 03-30-2023, 01:14 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-01T12:22:25-07:00","id":1507112,"title":"","content":"I think based on seeing Elpis' Nimbus using his Ruling Mage Sights and from the context clues of the muffled sound, Qaf can piece together what Elpis did, which is interesting since he expected them to cast the spell on themself.<br /> <br /> Since High Speech is not subtle and he doesn't want to give Jaye a reason to think he is preparing for things to escalate, I am going to leverage the fact that Qaf can wash his hands to make this a lot more subtle.<br /> <br /> He is going to cast <i>Kinetic Blow</i>, with Reach assigned to instant use, advanced duration, stunning and knocking down. Regarding yantras, he is going to use the rote's Brawl mudra and Qaf is going to spit on his hands (which can be done pretty quietly) as a material yantra simbolizing facilitating the flow of power. Then he is boosting Potency to 4. So the resulting dice pool would be:<br /> <br /> Gnosis (1) + Forces (2) + mudra (5) + material sympathy (2) + boosting Potency by 3 (-6) = 4<br /> <br /> [<b>10</b>, 6, 3, 1, 3]<br /> <br /> 1 success. So now Qaf's unarmed attacks have a +4 damage modifier, inflicting both Stunned and Knocked Down on hit. Combined with his professional training, that places the damage somewhere between being hit by a sniper shot and being mauled by a chainsaw, but far faster because there is no initiative penalty, plus each blow has the properties of a super taser. All of that added to the fact that its technically a very good holdout weapon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-fami