link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-08T12:05:22-07:00","id":1507774,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KaiserAfini</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1501180-in-the-hallowed-light-mtaw2e-ooc?p=1507771#post1507771\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Third option, that Qaf can't say out loud right now: use <i>Postcognition</i> to see Pandora's pre-Rapture soul stone and learn the Legacy from studying it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Elpis is considering a Goetic Evocation on the Rapt version. Qaf\u2019s way might be safer physically and politically, and less\u2026spiritually costly than going to Lilith. Problem is if Elpis don\u2019t learn the legacy from an \u201cofficial\u201d source, it\u2019s a problem for the mainline legacy. The legacy is relatively new, and controls who joins very tightly. They might never have had this problem before, and might over react.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-08T12:44:04-07:00","id":1507780,"title":"","content":"Yep, but Elpis was a recognized heir by Pandora's own volition, recognized as being greenlit to join by another member in front of Arrows (who can testify under Oath) and members of the Council. <br /> <br /> So the first option is learning from a member in another Consilia, which has political ramifications. The second optional is to bargain with a cosmic level entity for it, which seems like using a cannon to crack an egg. Third option is finding the Legacy's realm and hope there is a Grimmoire there or the location of one, but that requires a lot of mana to access the Astral, plus some deep searching in the Temenos. Fourth option is <i>Goetic Evocation</i>, which either requires being an Adept of Mind, or bargaining for the spell with one.<br /> <br /> Last option (that I can see) is learning via <i>Postcognition</i>, which neither involves stealing a confiscated resource, viewing it when its unstable or learning without permission. The main challenge is accessing the physical location where it was, but that feels like the most manageable risk available.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-08T15:16:45-07:00","id":1507787,"title":"","content":"Yep, definitely a good summary of our options. I still think using <i>Postcognition</i> carries some political risk, even if I have approval to join from Pandora and Ferdiad. I don\u2019t know, I guess it\u2019s like asking to borrow a book, the breaking into their house to get it. Like, yeah technically they said you could have it, but they still might be upset on how you got it.<br /> <br /> Is it possible to use Temporal Summoning to get a past version of the soul stone if we get it in our possession? I don\u2019t think Elpis wants to see the twisted demon wearing their mentor\u2019s face if they don\u2019t have to.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage 