, isn't it the theoretical holy grail that no mage ever saw ? Could they have mistaken it for crossing the Threshold ? After all, the Hierarch should have been swiftly kicked out of his position by simply pursuing the Imperial Mysteries, and its not like other archmages wouldn't do a quick check to make sure they disconnected when they joined. <br /> <br /> Pandora was a martyr, how ? The Bellerophon Group is not very well known according to <i>Nameless &amp; Accursed</i>, so I think its fair for Qaf to never have heard of them. <br /> <br /> The <i>Adamant Crown</i> somehow got the crown of Apollonius from wherever the British Guardians hid it, plus they are actually entrenched enough to make an open declaration? That is deeply concerning.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-10T16:07:45-07:00","id":1507973,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KaiserAfini</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1501180-in-the-hallowed-light-mtaw2e-ooc?p=1507970#post1507970\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">By the Oracles, a full scale Ascension? Wait, how do they even know what that looks like, isn't it the theoretical holy grail that no mage ever saw ? Could they have mistaken it for crossing the Threshold ? After all, the Hierarch should have been swiftly kicked out of his position by simply pursuing the Imperial Mysteries, and its not like other archmages wouldn't do a quick check to make sure they disconnected when they joined.</div> </div> </div> </div> ...I'm reading that as code for killing and hiding the body <b>very</b> thoroughly. Or maybe dropping them outside of Time for a while.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KaiserAfini</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1501180-in-the-hallowed-light-mtaw2e-ooc?p=1507970#post1507970\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Pandora was a martyr, how ? The Bellerophon Group is not very well known according to <i>Nameless &amp; Accursed</i>, so I think its fair for Qaf to never have heard of them.</div> </div> </div> </div> I'm ruling Elpis hasn't either, mostly because I think a research thing on them will be fun. Or if that's too implausible, Elpis just forgot their name on one of the books they read. As for the Martyr bit, given that these named Legacies are all about transcending the physical, it might be an experiment to push the known boundaries that broke her soul. or maybe something went wrong with the Elan transformation.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KaiserAfini</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1501180-in-the-hallowed-light-mtaw2e-ooc?p=1507970#post1507970\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The <i>Adamant Crown</i> somehow got the crown of Apollonius from wherever the British Guardians hid it, plus they are actually entrenched enough to make an open declaration? That is deeply concerning.</div> </div> </div> </div> And I'm loving the setup so far. <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachmen