},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-20T10:24:07-07:00","id":1509057,"title":"","content":"Thank you for finally jumping on that. I couldn\u2019t think of a way for Elpis to naturally shift the conversation towards Nighthawk\u2019s \u201cautocratic bureaucracy\u201d comment.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-20T10:38:43-07:00","id":1509064,"title":"","content":"No problem. Clean Sweep was smart enough to stay sober, since mages cannot resist the lure of a Mystery, and we have an inkling of suspicion about the meeting.<br /> <br /> But Nighthawk is probably just stressed, so is drinking and blowing off steam. Now its a difficult balancing act between answering a valid question from the natural flow of the conversation and changing the topic without making Elpis more suspicious. Qaf deliberately placed a conundrum to Clean Sweep. <br /> <br /> Its still possible to deflect it, but Elpis already said Qaf likes to be prepared, which might justify the question even more to Nighthawk.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-21T08:00:10-07:00","id":1509186,"title":"","content":"&quot;Clearly the Order head, veteran warrior and master spy placed all the basic wards on the important secret meeting.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Nah, I think we all just forgot. We are just that outraged, and I am a little tipsy&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;NANI !? How come I am more careful than these experienced mages ?&quot;<br /> <br /> Its hilarious how much he overerestimated the situation. Not sure how to jump to more details on the Consilium and Pandora, Qaf was taken aback a bit by the realization.\u200b","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are 