May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-21T13:10:36-07:00","id":1509228,"title":"","content":"Well, Nighthawk IS the Free Council chair. She gets along with the rest of the Consilium, but at the end of the day she's not a fan of keeping secrets or laying ridged restrictions on people. Plus, learning her Legacy by beating up Ghosts means she really doesn't grok how initiating without permission would be a crime. To her, it's a personal path of enlightenment and as such should only be obstructed if someone is going Reaper or Banisher.<br /> <br /> As to why they all neglected their defenses... well, short answer, Cloudchaser was the only one of the five who has Time. Their lack of soundproofing was just sloppiness though, given that there were two Forces Masters and one Adept.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":""