br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-04T15:48:03-07:00","id":1510726,"title":"","content":"Cool, hope you did well on the exams, the weekend is pretty free for me as well.<br /> <br /> There is one more thing that I think could be helpful to the Consilium, but it requires an Acanthus, or at least someone who knows Fate and Spirit/Time. The idea is to use both Arcana to enchant a watch into becoming a mini version of the Cold War's doomsday clock, this can be accomplished by reading the zeitgeist, the spirit of the times, and using an Unveiling to show how close you are to some broad event (or more specific ones with a Reach). If you ever read the <i>Watchmen </i>comic, its the same idea. Unlike Time divination, this doesn't require a specific target, but it does allow them one more way to gauge the severity of the situation and make more informed decisions.<br /> <br /> Not sure if it would be helpful to pitch the idea to either mage we are talking to. But its definitely something Qaf would suggest.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspirati