omewhat unrelated. <br /> is there a map of Little Atlantis already made?<br /> <br /> Also I read a little bit of the Tome of Penticle preview. Philly seems like exactly the Constructor faction in Silver Ladder. Which could be interesting if Qaf is going in the ruins mystery hunter direction.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-22T19:47:59-07:00","id":1512400,"title":"","content":"In that case, I think we would need to roll teamwork actions for Academic and Occult research. Then we can compile them. I think Elpis should be the lead, then we could figure out the next steps (Active Sight, follow up research) and know where we start post timeskip, does that sound good ?<br /> <br /> Philly is from the Conservators, Qaf being interested in ruin delving, plus I think Dragon Bones (super soul stones that only work inside ruins of the Time Before) would probably be fascinating for Elpis' study of the soul and Nimbus. We were struggling with a cabal name and theme before, maybe archeomancy could be a focus.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.c