ts and not flag you as spam. It should unlock after a day or two, once the mods see it. Did you change any of your dialog much from the initial post? If not, I can keep rolling","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-06T23:23:27-07:00","id":1514082,"title":"","content":"Yeah, the edit bot can vicious. Sometimes it zaps your posts for basically no reason. I've stopped trying to make sense of it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-07T03:00:15-07:00","id":1514100,"title":"","content":"No dialog change. Just that it was a spirit not a mind spell.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-07T16:50:27-07:00","id":1514144,"title":"","content":"Maube they recalibrated it, just had another post zapped today, it seems like its becoming more active lately.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-07T17:14:08-07:00","id":1514147,"title":"","content":"I can repost. Basically I questioned the morality of using spirits to directly influence someone's thoughts (a very idealistic and probably inconsistent view); reminisced about Philly's childhood growing up surrounded by mages who dismissed wisdom and warnings about hubris; grew excited (obsessed?) about the cottage and the mysteries there; and then asked Chevalier about who my new cabal fellows would be?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-08T18:35:54-07:00","id":1514257,"title":"","content":"So just so I can start figuring out more about the quantumly uncertain state that Philly will run into Elpis and Qaf. If I remember correctly, Elpis does not have the Library merit, so they would probably be in a study room in the public library ? I think that a study room would allow them to speak about the Mysteries without being suspicious or causing Quiescense, plus have space for laptops, books and a screen.<br /> <br /> Since Elpis was able to make a few more rolls, I imagine they would still be reading a few details and then gets the message from the contractor. Qaf would arrive with some coffee in nonspill cups and probably some information on a lead that didn't pan out. How does that sound ?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-09T04:11:22-07:00","id":1514292,"title":"","content":"The public library in Little Atlantis? The occult book section rivals the highschool library in Sunnydale.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-09T12:27:11-07:00","id":1514331,"title":"","content":"Random question. Is there an Ant Man like legacy? Transform size of ones self and other objects, communication with insects, etc.?<br /> <br /> Edit: I was just thinking, would quiescense be triggered if the will worker were only half an inch tall. Or like if you literally turned into a fly like in recent D&amp;D movie (Obviously wouldn't work for Mages, like in the movie. I mean for sleepers.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","user":"CalvinSiler","date":". 06-09-2023, 03:33 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-09T12:51:51-07:00","id":1514334,"title":"","content":"No Ant Man Legacies exist afaik. The shrinking would need to be supplemented with teleportation for general convenience, so maybe Space and Life would be its Arcana combination. It sounds pretty cool, and the utility of shrinking or enlarging people and objects can have a lot of creative uses.<br /> <br /> A normal spell would trigger Quiescense, but Legacies are Free From The Lie, meaning Sleepers always remember. If you teleport, become a giant, sprint at top speed through traffic or create weapons out of thin air, they will always remember. Its a drawback of the Legacy that I plan to have Qaf join, it was made to keep people alive in archeomancy expeditions, the Attainments were designed with no consideration to the Veil, which means members need to be careful not to be so overt as to gain the ire of the Guardians.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 06-09-2023, 04:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-09T14:51:58-07:00","id":1514340,"title":"","content":"I guess what I meant was would an unobserved shrunken mage trigger dissonance, similar to a mage magically disguised or rendered invisible. Obviously witnessing the shrinking or embigening would trigger it. Does it have to be conscious, or are you saying that even if they can't see the mage with their naked eyes (&quot;Dad, don't eat me!&quot; While inside a Cheerio) the sleeping soul knows that magic is present in an extrasensory way?<br /> <br /> Edit: I feel like the metaphysics of dissonance is somewhat ambiguous. Is it the mere fact of the sleeper's soul's sympathetic connection to the abyss, or is perception/consciousness a necessary trigger. If the former is the case, it would explain why verges tend to be stronger in less inhabited areas. The actual number of sleeper souls widens the abyss in a region.<br /> <br /> To wit, perhaps one explanation for the high number of hallows in Little A is actually the high number of sleepwakers and awakened per capita.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","user":"CalvinSiler","date":". 06-09-2023, 06:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-09T15:11:51-07:00","id":1514342,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mage: The Awakening 2ed, page 298</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"> A Sleeper\u2019s soul is given a choice, therefore, between a Truth that cannot be understood and a terrible, impossible alternative as offered by the Abyss. Her choice is a non-choice, and so she Sleeps. That non-choice is the Curse</div> </div> </div> </div>Based on that, I imagine its triggered in situations they cannot rationalize away as anything but magic. So if they believe they were hearing things because they were tired, or that its some kind of prank, the mage is fine. If the person doesn't think any of those are realistic explanations (&quot;she is too serious to make pranks&quot; or &quot;that sounded too clear to be ventriloquism or a small loudspeaker&quot;) then they start to corrode the spell and the Curse forces them to accept a deluded explanation of what they saw (&quot;she taped her smartphone under the table and activated it remotely to play the sound, then snatched it into her pocket when I found out&quot;).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 06-09-2023, 06:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-09T16:19:02-07:00","id":1514351,"title":"","content":"Hmm. So one possible path for a Mage could be to train in Expression with a skill specialty in stage illusion. That way actual magic could be more easily passed off as illusion.<br /> <br /> This does have actual application to Philly. Her specialities could be purposed towards traditional sleeper magic items such as potions, candles, herbal remedies and so on. So long as the effects were not spectacular, quiesence would not be too disturbed. Now the question is with high enough expression skill, could she perform genuine exorcisms without disturbing the peace.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-09T16:38:07-07:00","id":1514353,"title":"","content":"Somewhat related. What supernatural being best reflects the supernal truth of tininess? Wizened changelings are slightly more diminutive than normal human size, but they are not typically so small as to bear resemblance to archetypes of pixies, brownies, or more recent sleeper dreams like the Borrowers or Secret World of Arrietty. Could there be a root people that reflected this supernal truth by being only a few inches high? (And possibly live in the cottage garden!)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-09T16:59:32-07:00","id":1514358,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1501180-in-the-hallowed-light-mtaw2e-ooc?p=1514351#post1514351\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmm. So one possible path for a Mage could be to train in Expression with a skill specialty in stage illusion. That way actual magic could be more easily passed off as illusion.<br /> <br /> This does have actual application to Philly. Her specialities could be purposed towards traditional sleeper magic items such as potions, candles, herbal remedies and so on. So long as the effects were not spectacular, quiesence would not be too disturbed. Now the question is with high enough expression skill, could she perform genuine exorcisms without disturbing the peace.</div> </div> </div> </div>It depends on how she goes about it. Technically she can just tap someone on the shoulder and cast <i>Banishment</i> as an instant action when she has Spirit 4.<br /> <br /> It becomes more complicated depending on how she adds yantras to the equation. Did she throw water at them to invoke the Shinto symbolism of purification or as a playful gesture ? Did she remove that wristband with a laburnum (also called the golden chain) motiff because it symbolizes removing the poisonous link between host and spirit, or is it just a personality quirk ? Its all a matter of how discretely she works the yantras into the situation.<br /> <br /> One of my favorite things is that Thyrsus and Acanthus both tend to pick up &quot;unusual behaviors&quot; as they learn their Arcana. The Acanthus is unreasonably possessive of his lucky gun because he has spells with Conditional Duration that say they end if someone else uses it. The Thyrsus has to stop and light every candle she sees because of a deal they made with a light spirit and they carry a whistle made of a bird bone to help them locate a spirit of cats they want as a familiar.\u200b","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-09T17:50:26-07:00","id":1514363,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KaiserAfini</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1501180-in-the-hallowed-light-mtaw2e-ooc?p=1514358#post1514358\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> One of my favorite things is that Thyrsus and Acanthus both tend to pick up &quot;unusual behaviors&quot; as they learn their Arcana.\u200b</div> </div> </div> </div>Right. Obrimoi are significantly less <a href=\"https://youtu.be/aZJZK6rzjns\" target=\"_blank\">quirky</a>.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-09T18:40:54-07:00","id":1514373,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KaiserAfini</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1501180-in-the-hallowed-light-mtaw2e-ooc?p=1514257#post1514257\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Since Elpis was able to make a few more rolls, I imagine they would still be reading a few details and then gets the message from the contractor. Qaf would arrive with some coffee in nonspill cups and probably some information on a lead that didn't pan out. How does that sound ?</div> </div> </div> </div>I think that sounds good. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27258_4.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27258\" data-vbnamecard=\"27258\">Cauthon</a>? How do you feel about it?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-09T18:48:17-07:00","id":1514375,"title":"","content":"Obrimos quirks also be like:<br /> <br /> \u201cThe building was on fire, and it wasn\u2019t my fault.\u201d\u200b<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-09T21:16:30-07:00","id":1514394,"title":"","content":"<i>Spell Potion</i> requires Matter 3 and Prime 2. Changing size would be either Life 3 (for organic targets) or Space 3 (universally applicable).<br /> <br /> You mentioned exorcisms and tinyness.<br /> <br /> Regarding the exorcism theme, the <i>Gaolers of Ialdabaoth</i> are dedicated specialists, not only can they deal with ghosts and spirits, they can even lock away Abyssal beings. Their history is very cool as well, being tied to a Grimmoire and a hidden temple in the Temenos, inscribed with a extremely ancient High Speech dialect. But they use Spirit and Death, so its not the most attuned with your current build.<br /> <br /> The <i>Orphans of Proteus</i> have talking to animals and shapeshifting covered, plus some healing as well. They use Matter and Life, which synergizes well with Philly's Arcana.\u200b","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-10T04:16:04-07:00","id":1514447,"title":"","content":"Well, I'm only 59 beats away from making potions then, and 39 till I can turn into an animal!<br /> <br /> As soon as <a href=\"https://38.media.tumblr.com/6b2e3c5083397302977d38d95c0b1728/tumblr_mr43coXAY61qhokqho1_1280.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">Chevalier</a> and Philly finish their blueberry soup and complementary beef and mushroom torte - while Qaf and Elpis are at the <a href=\"https://media.npr.org/assets/img/2019/03/27/gettyimages-1133149404-5990e7250fec7faf3830e6b7516481cd0d35a0ae-s1100-c50.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">library</a> (#Obrimoi#whyNOTonfire?).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","user":"CalvinSiler","date":". 06-10-2023, 07:21 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-10T17:49:29-07:00","id":1514528,"title":"","content":"Speaking of which, one of Qaf's initial Aspirations is &quot;Form a cabal&quot; and &quot;Become a better Arrow&quot;, since he needs that field experience before looking into the Angel's Mystery. Should I change either of them ? I am not sure if the second one is too vague, its meant to represent trying to be less green. Regarding the first one, we currently don't have a name, sigil or declared which Great Rights we follow, so I could see why its work in progress.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-10T18:14:23-07:00","id":1514530,"title":"","content":"You were officially declared a banner warden, which could count as a beat for both.<br /> <br /> Since each order has defined doctrines, it doesn't seem too vague to me. As long as you have remained loyal to the precepts of the Hand despite being challenged in some way, you are progressing towards becoming a better Arrow.<br /> <br /> Edits: it's actually a great aspiration because the ST can plan stories that thematically link to the precepts of the order e.g. Service is Mastery, how does that relate to the Adamantine Crown?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","user":"CalvinSiler","date":". 06-10-2023, 09:20 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-11T16:38:14-07:00","id":1514635,"title":"","content":"IRL my mother was just talking to her flowers, telling them they aren't blooming enough. #ThyrsusLife","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-11T16:39:43-07:00","id":1514636,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar26736_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"26736\" data-vbnamecard=\"26736\">TempleBuilder</a> What are Elpis' aspirations?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-12T06:46:50-07:00","id":1514693,"title":"","content":"Uh, probably in need of an update. Let's see.<br /> <br /> Aspirations:<br /> &quot;Find someone who can see the past&quot;<br /> &quot;Discover the Truth behind Pandora's death and Rapture&quot;<br /> &quot;Become a positive legacy for Pandora&quot;<br /> \u200b<br /> Obsessions:<br /> &quot;The mechanics of Rapture&quot;<br /> \u200b<br /> Yeah, looks like the first one is fulfilled. It was supposed to be easy, part of our character introductions. I think it's probably safe to say it's been replaced with &quot;Purify Hyleen\u200b Cottage of tainted resonance&quot;. It's still short-term...ish, but involves tearing town the torture spell, and resolving whatever is causing the bad vibes around the neighborhood. It's also a good reason for Elpis to invite Philly to stick around and maybe join the Cabal.<br /> <br /> I am wondering if I should shift back the Obsession to Elpis' more persistent one: &quot;Nimbus Phenomena&quot;. The previous one was to represent their state of mind trying to cope with Pandora's death on their own...but I think hanging out with Qaf and having something of an achievable goal is helping their emotional state. That in turn should help let them stop fixating so hard on something so painful for them...but it might be too early. Thoughts?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-12T08:24:00-07:00","id":1514705,"title":"","content":"&quot;Find someone who can see the past&quot; sounds fulfilled, but we need an official ruling by Cauthon on the ones for both characters.<br /> <br /> One short term, one mid term and one long term Aspiration, sounds well balanced. I think the Hyleen Cottage one is especially interesting, because we were never told if we could dispel it, we don't have context on what it was made for either. If the Practice was Left-Handed, why wasn't it dispelled rather than contained ? Would it allow Elpis to safely summon a Supernal Entity that may be of aid uncovering what happened to Pandora ? All interesting questions they could consider.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-12T08:53:33-07:00","id":1514708,"title":"","content":"I think grief takes a lot longer than most people expect, and sometimes hidden thoughts and emotions stir in unexpected ways. I think it is definitely an interesting thing to explore in RP. Having a goal and feeling like you have a sense of purpose that continues beyond what one's mentor was pursuing is important.<br /> <br /> I also think that I also need to shift things around a bit as things have come into focus more. I'm thinking<br /> <br /> 1. Make mundane repairs to Hyleen Cottage and make it a comfortable and useful sanctum for the cabal.<br /> 2. Change the resonance of the Cottage to something more in keeping with nimbi of the cabal (Hopeful, joyful, energetic and productive).<br /> 3. (Long Term) Gain rank and status within Spirit Choir (Requires Spirit 4).<br /> <br /> Obsession<br /> Sleepers and Awakening (Maybe connected to Ruins in the Deep)<br /> <br /> Can't wait for Philly to meet Elpis and Qaf. It will be fun!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-12T09:06:29-07:00","id":1514710,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cauthon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1501179-in-the-hallowed-light-mtaw2e-ic?p=1508726#post1508726\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Clean Sweep looks troubled. &quot;Hyleen? Nasty place. No spirits this side of the Gauntlet though - you get some pretty bad Apathy, Sloth, and Dispair spirits in that neighborhood, but they can feed well on the ley-flows without crossing over. Been like that for centuries, as far as the Shadowwalker records can tell. No one knows why. Me and my Shoal do a sweep around there sometimes, but as you can see, weather spirits are more my specialty.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe Philly can add something to the investigation by exploring the shadow. And if it's been like that for centuries then changing the resonance might be a tall order.<br /> \u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-12T14:39:21-07:00","id":1514762,"title":"","content":"I'm on a road trip, so I've been thinking and driving.<br /> <br /> How comfortable are you all with like the more stereotypical aspects of Thyrus' personality, i.e. body positive, &quot;humans are just animals&quot;. I'm not planning on being super explicit, just, you know, its part of being a Thyrsus.<br /> <br /> Maybe I should have asked earlier. Life is the gross arcanum, but I don\u2019t want to gross you all out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-12T17:27:42-07:00","id":1514782,"title":"","content":"I\u2019m fine with Thyrsus being in tune with their bodies and stuff. Some of my favorite media involved large amounts of body horror. Life is just kinda gross in general, and as someone who grew up on the internet, I\u2019ve seen some things I really would rather not. (Actually, lots of gross stuff in the real world too.) And I\u2019m fine now, possibly better for it. Anyways, you\u2019re good, you do you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-12T18:46:05-07:00","id":1514784,"title":"","content":"Yep, I'm fine with that. Sometimes you need to turn a pack of cats into dinosaurs, just as sometimes you need to use sonic resonance to shatter a tank.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-12T18:48:26-07:00","id":1514785,"title":"","content":"IRL one of my main phobia is body horror. So if <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27258_4.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27258\" data-vbnamecard=\"27258\">Cauthon</a> wants to put the Darkness in Chronicles of Darkness, that would be the way to do it for me (like you said, not necessarily a bad thing. Sometimes being scared is fun)<br /> <br /> I guess I was more thinking about the whole gardener/farmer vs. hunter/predator aspect of the Thyrsus Path. The book tends to emphasize the hunter/predator aspect of life systems and the spirit world. And then I was thinking (While driving, so thoughts wander) about social dynamics and dominance hierarchies (Alphas and Betas) and the concept of territory.<br /> <br /> And then I was thinking about the potential that there is either no bathroom or only one bathroom, and two designated bedrooms in the cottage. And then I was thinking about how Philly would think through all of those things, like is she more of a &quot;Everything that is mine is yours&quot; (my inclination) or whether she is more territorial.<br /> <br /> And then I had like this mental image of like Philly's bra hanging on the shower curtain rod, and I was like would saying something like that IC gross you all out. So that was more what I was thinking. (I think it would be super inappropriate/weird to do &quot;Mature Content&quot; so I'm definitely not planning on that!)\u200b<br /> <br /> But if <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27258_4.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27258\" data-vbnamecard=\"27258\">Cauthon</a> wants to throw flesh-eating insects or something like that at us (I'm rereading some Hellblazer* to set the mood), I'm down.<br /> <br /> *Giving me ideas for exorcisms and spirit combat.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-12T18:56:10-07:00","id":1514786,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KaiserAfini</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1501180-in-the-hallowed-light-mtaw2e-ooc?p=1514784#post1514784\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yep, I'm fine with that. Sometimes you need to turn a pack of cats into dinosaurs, just as sometimes you need to use sonic resonance to shatter a tank.</div> </div> </div> </div>LoL. I did once kill a mook with <a href=\"https://media.tenor.com/Po7zLzVxSjAAAAAM/bees-not-the-bees.gif\" target=\"_blank\">bees</a> as a Thyrsus. That was a wisdom check from that ST. <a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/x-files/images/8/89/Teso_Dos_Bichos.jpeg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/250?cb=20191210153118\" target=\"_blank\">Cats</a> can be <a href=\"https://i.etsystatic.com/9309262/r/il/bdfcc3/4326125358/il_570xN.4326125358_1mme.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">scary</a> all on their own without becoming dinosaurs!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-12T20:13:00-07:00","id":1514793,"title":"","content":"Rabbits are my pick for the most disturbing, due to both in the <i>Re:Zero</i> book and anime, they are one of the most disturbing depictions of the devouring swarm out there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-12T20:53:55-07:00","id":1514795,"title":"","content":"\u2026I think Elpis wouldn\u2019t care about like the odd article of clothing outside of making sure it ended up with the proper owner. I\u2019m sure they have seen bra gardens before, and are used to it. Maybe they would be mildly worried about hygiene, like \u201cmake sure you clean it before it get mildew or something\u201d vibes. They would be more concerned that everyone gets their own space though. As something of an introvert, sometimes they just need privacy, and they would want everyone in the cabal to have what they have as their idea of fairness. So we might need some creative solutions to the number of bedrooms.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-13T03:42:54-07:00","id":1514817,"title":"","content":"Theoretically, there is a basement. That, and where the <span style=\"color:#3498db\"><a href=\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Literature/HouseOfLeaves\" target=\"_blank\">bathroom</a> </span>is, are the real mysteries of the cottage! <br /> <br /> Perhaps ironically, considering the exhaustive length of time I spent speculating on Philly's mom's <a href=\"https://i.etsystatic.com/11163374/r/il/27a160/2416923279/il_fullxfull.2416923279_e5kl.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">family</a>, fish freak me out the most. They have googly eyes and weird mouths. And basically all the other things that live in the ocean are scary. And the ocean itself is scary.<br /> <br /> But also beautiful and sublime. Its funny how sometimes we are drawn to the things that frighten us.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-13T03:47:47-07:00","id":1514819,"title":"","content":"So Elpis is more of a &quot;Label names on things in the refrigerator&quot; kind of housemate. Good to know.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-13T05:55:00-07:00","id":1514833,"title":"","content":"Per Kaiser's comments about three dot Athletics, I've been researching Olympic swimmers. Apparently Abbey Weitzeil is really into <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/aw_refurbished/\" target=\"_blank\">furniture restoration</a>! Crafts 2 dots!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-13T14:04:37-07:00","id":1514880,"title":"","content":"As has probably been apparent, I'm running into IRL difficulties that have made it hard to keep up the game. Unfortunately, it looks like I'm not going to have them resolved until August at the earliest - my contract here in Japan ends then, and I'm trying to sort out my next job (which dictates where I'll be moving).<br /> <br /> We can try picking this up again later, though I'm not confident on when I'll be able to. Alternatively, i can shoot my game notes to one of you if you want to keep running the game yourself<br /> <br /> Sorry guys","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-13T15:05:23-07:00","id":1514882,"title":"","content":"I\u2019m sorry to hear that. I hope you find out where you will be ending up soon. It sucks not to know something so important. On a more practical note. I\u2019d prefer to try again in August, if that\u2019s ok.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":26736,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","user":"TempleBuilder","date":". 06-13-2023, 06:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-13T15:09:38-07:00","id":1514883,"title":"","content":"I had one lined up... then it turned out the Army had fucked up my paperwork and cost me that job offer. And the one after that, since they <i>still</i> haven't sorted it out almost a month later. Means I can't bothef applying to half the jobs I'm qualified for. I'm... quite irritated.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-13T15:51:34-07:00","id":1514891,"title":"","content":"Sorry to here about IRL problems. Job uncertainty and living situation being up in the air definitely sucks. <br /> <br /> I'm fine with waiting for August for &quot;In the Hallowed Light&quot;. If its any reassurance, I definitely am interested in where the story is going. It's a cool world you've made for the characters.<br /> <br /> What do you think <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a>?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-13T16:50:40-07:00","id":1514897,"title":"","content":"I'm sorry to hear, its incredibly frustrating that they were careless with such important paperwork. <br /> <br /> I would be more than happy to resume in August, I think the setting is very interesting and I am intrigued to see where it is going.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br